      <description><![CDATA[<h3 id="fixed">Fixed</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Accurate Conversion Rate and TTR on multi-day date
ranges.</strong> The Conv. Rate and TTR columns in the campaigns, ad
groups, and keywords tables now compute as <code>installs ÷ taps</code>
and <code>taps ÷ impressions</code> over the selected range, matching
the toolbar summary. Previously these columns averaged each day’s rate,
which read visibly off when daily traffic was uneven.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
